14. QueryUnderstandingProvider

Create an interface:

QueryUnderstandingProvider

Example:

class QueryUnderstandingProvider:
generate_logical_query(…)
generate_sql(…)

Implement:

DatabricksGenieProvider

as the initial V1 implementation.

Create an OpenAIProvider interface/implementation point for the near future.

