18. Data Product vs Physical Source

A Data Product must be a logical/business abstraction.

Example:

Dental Claims

may map to:

catalog.schema.claims
catalog.schema.provider
catalog.schema.member

Today these may all be Databricks objects.

In the future:

Dental Claims
|
+– Databricks
+– SQL Server
+– Azure SQL

The citizen developer should still see:

Dental Claims

not:

