27. Example Query Request

POST /query

{
“question”: “How many rejected dental claims did we have last month?”,
“data_product”: “dental_claims”
}

The server must NOT simply send this directly to an LLM.

It must first:

1. Resolve identity.
2. Check business entitlement.
3. Resolve data product.
4. Retrieve semantic context.
5. Invoke the QueryUnderstandingProvider.
6. Validate generated SQL.
7. Verify data-product scope.
8. Execute.
9. Audit.
10. Return result.

