31. V1 Dental POC

Use one domain:

DENTAL

Use approximately:

3–10 representative tables/views.

Create:

1. One Dental data product.
2. One Dental citizen-developer business group.
3. One authorized test user.
4. One unauthorized test user.
5. One Databricks provider.
6. One Genie Agent.
7. 10–20 representative natural-language questions.
8. Positive authorization tests.
9. Negative authorization tests.
10. SQL guardrail tests.
11. Technical Unity Catalog authorization tests.

