38. V1 Definition of Done

The V1 is complete when this end-to-end scenario works:

Alice belongs to:

DENTAL_CITIZEN_DEVELOPER

Business metadata maps:

DENTAL_CITIZEN_DEVELOPER
->
Dental
->
Dental Claims

Alice sends through Cloud CoWork:

“How many rejected dental claims did we have last month?”

FastAPI:

1. Identifies Alice.
2. Resolves her groups.
3. Confirms Dental Claims entitlement.
4. Retrieves Dental semantic context.
5. Sends the bounded context to Genie.
6. Receives generated SQL/logical query.
7. Parses SQL.
8. Rejects unsafe SQL if necessary.
9. Confirms physical objects are within Dental Claims scope.
10. Executes through Databricks.
11. Unity Catalog enforces technical access.
12. Returns only the actual authorized result.
13. Records an audit event.
14. Returns the result to Cloud CoWork.

Then execute the same request with Bob:

PET_CITIZEN_DEVELOPER

Expected:

Business authorization fails.

Genie/LLM is NOT called.

Databricks is NOT called.

The request is audited as DENIED.

