The application should be designed so that:

* Microsoft Graph can replace the mock identity provider.
* OpenAI can replace Genie.
* SQL Server can become another DataSourceProvider.
* Azure SQL can become another DataSourceProvider.
* New domains can be added through metadata/configuration.
* New data products can be added without rewriting authorization logic.
* Physical data locations can change without changing the citizen-developer interface.

